# Sample Ooda CLI Build Invocation

File: cli/examples/build.oot

## Build a .oo file

```sh
ooda build src/main.oo --out build/main --emit c
```

This invokes `cli/build/host_build.oo::run_oodac_build` with `(fs_r, fs_w, sys, env, ["src/main.oo", "--out", "build/main", "--emit", "c"])`.

## Run a .oo file

```sh
ooda run src/main.oo
```

This invokes `cli/build/host_build.oo::run_oodac_run`.

## Time a .oo file

```sh
ooda bench src/main.oo --run
```

This invokes `cli/build/bench.oo::run_ooda_bench` and prints `ooda bench: check src/main.oo Nms` and (if --run) `ooda bench: run src/main.oo Nms`.
